{
    "word": "biotechnology",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "e91cfc3b-50df-32ac-a13a-0f7234a19dcc",
                "word": "biotechnology",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "304fc40c-c710-4a75-86ed-73337f1b7051",
                        "entry_id": "e91cfc3b-50df-32ac-a13a-0f7234a19dcc",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "biotechnologies"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c745cdd5-b390-39c3-839e-4e6bc9b0d9c2",
                        "entry_id": "e91cfc3b-50df-32ac-a13a-0f7234a19dcc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The use of living organisms (especially microorganisms) in industrial, agricultural, medical and other technological applications."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable",
                            "usually"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "297dbc3c-b467-4eb4-9408-376cb177ba19",
                                "sense_id": "c745cdd5-b390-39c3-839e-4e6bc9b0d9c2",
                                "text": "Japan's strength lies in more traditional biotechnology such as fermentation."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f871ba96-543c-4177-9bf3-6995c7f65eae",
                                "sense_id": "c745cdd5-b390-39c3-839e-4e6bc9b0d9c2",
                                "text": "The developments in biotechnology, particularly with the basic understanding of genetics, immunology, biochemistry, biochemical engineering and molecular biology, have paved the way for major biotechnology products and processes and have provided tools to the manufacturing and service industry."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "af9cae8f-6812-4ff7-8b93-c6662cd3cdbd",
                                "sense_id": "c745cdd5-b390-39c3-839e-4e6bc9b0d9c2",
                                "text": "Moreover, Arnhart points out that both the proponents and critics of biotechnology are compelled to appeal to our natural moral sense."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c49d2ee5-b66a-3b7b-b3a9-8a988a2f501a",
                        "entry_id": "e91cfc3b-50df-32ac-a13a-0f7234a19dcc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The application of the principles and practices of engineering and technology to the life sciences."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable",
                            "usually"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "081a0469-0823-4ece-889c-bb0ba2b6fef3",
                                "sense_id": "c49d2ee5-b66a-3b7b-b3a9-8a988a2f501a",
                                "text": "Agricultural biotechnology comprises a collection of scientific techniques, including genetic engineering, that are used to modify and improve plants, animals and microorganisms for human profit. Agricultural biotechnologies are not a substitute for conventional plant and animal breeding, but can be a powerful complement to improving the efficiency and sustainability of agricultural production."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3bd36491-73c9-4ab9-bf7e-f0a9f6fcd01f",
                                "sense_id": "c49d2ee5-b66a-3b7b-b3a9-8a988a2f501a",
                                "text": "2008, Yutaka Tanaka, Attitude toward Bioethics and Acceptance of Biotechnology, William G. Flynne (editor), Biotechnology and Bioengineering, page 175,\nThe result of study 3 suggests that the factor of bioethics is important not only for the acceptance of biotechnologies themselves, such as gene recombination technology and clone technology, but also the acceptance of foods and products which are produced by the use of biotechnologies."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d05cfdb7-0f2e-4463-97d8-8d7bc0844600",
                                "sense_id": "c49d2ee5-b66a-3b7b-b3a9-8a988a2f501a",
                                "text": "It therefore follows that we need to ensure that the conception, development, dissemination and application of biotechnologies are held to ethical democratic standars which ensure gender equality."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8b299f4e-3c87-3b2a-b72f-ec1fed680011",
                        "entry_id": "e91cfc3b-50df-32ac-a13a-0f7234a19dcc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "genetic engineering"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable",
                            "usually"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8ce8ce46-386e-43fb-8e1e-fdd10c56f322",
                        "source_entry_id": "e91cfc3b-50df-32ac-a13a-0f7234a19dcc",
                        "source_sense_description": "use of living organisms in industrial, agricultural, medical applications",
                        "target_lang_word": "biotechnologie",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "biotechnologie",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "84fcc455-689f-37b0-ae2f-2c3eb08b296c",
                                        "entry_id": "64b73b02-3812-3558-b55b-b654d8b61e37",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Utilisation d’êtres vivants, en particulier de microorganismes dans des applications industrielles, agricoles, médicales ou technologiques."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "16d3dc43-5e9f-4ab1-ab28-4f3d04ff74a9",
                                                "sense_id": "84fcc455-689f-37b0-ae2f-2c3eb08b296c",
                                                "text": "Le Laboratoire de Biotechnologie de l'Environnement (LBE) de l’INRA est spécialisé dans la recherche et le développement des procédés biologiques pour le traitement des effluents et des résidus solides d'origines agricoles, urbaines et industrielles."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "26b1a4a4-9626-3720-ba13-5ab2ac0b62ac",
                                        "entry_id": "64b73b02-3812-3558-b55b-b654d8b61e37",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Application des principes de l’ingéniérie technologique au monde du vivant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "adc4f3ee-9901-4a78-a640-766e428dca03",
                                                "sense_id": "26b1a4a4-9626-3720-ba13-5ab2ac0b62ac",
                                                "text": "Le secteur de la santé fait de plus en plus appel aux biotechnologies pour concevoir, tester et produire des médicaments spécifiques."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8337aed7-94d4-4913-8324-d86f118ab3fa",
                                                "sense_id": "26b1a4a4-9626-3720-ba13-5ab2ac0b62ac",
                                                "text": "La cour d’appel de Lyon a confirmé, jeudi 10 septembre, la responsabilité de Monsanto dans la maladie de Paul François, céréalier charentais intoxiqué par l’herbicide Lasso du géant américain des biotechnologies."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8a7cd322-6642-4bec-a314-e337eaacb869",
                        "source_entry_id": "e91cfc3b-50df-32ac-a13a-0f7234a19dcc",
                        "source_sense_description": "use of living organisms in industrial, agricultural, medical applications",
                        "target_lang_word": "Biotechnologie",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Biotechnologie",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3e71e36b-e6c7-3163-9560-20c540573595",
                                        "entry_id": "d3493342-328a-39ed-837f-4bad14126ad6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Wissenschaft des technischen Einsatzes von Mikroorganismen, pflanzlichen oder tierischen Zellkulturen oder Enzymen zur Produktgewinnung oder zum Stoffabbau"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8cebf665-7d30-40f4-aa2a-af98500a2aa6",
                                                "sense_id": "3e71e36b-e6c7-3163-9560-20c540573595",
                                                "text": "Mittels der modernen Methoden der Biotechnologie werden heute vielerlei Arzneistoffe gewonnen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "56d2168f-c7b8-48c6-99e7-a2ebef748770",
                                                "sense_id": "3e71e36b-e6c7-3163-9560-20c540573595",
                                                "text": "Die meisten Biotech-Unternehmen sind in der medizinischen Biotechnologie aktiv."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c02ac6c4-3441-4a86-a51c-f7e52de2500b",
                                                "sense_id": "3e71e36b-e6c7-3163-9560-20c540573595",
                                                "text": "„Im Bereich der industriellen Biotechnologie liegt ein Schwerpunkt auf umweltfreundlicheren Verfahren und Produkten, zum Beispiel durch Entwicklung von Biochemikalien, Ersatz von konventionellen Kunststoffen oder Einsatz von Enzymen und Mikroorganismen bei der Produktion oder zum Schadstoffabbau.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "83a7ffa5-2906-476c-b2e7-5053c2c72aab",
                                                "sense_id": "3e71e36b-e6c7-3163-9560-20c540573595",
                                                "text": "„Zu dieser Kollision wird es mit Sicherheit an der Nahtstelle zwischen Nanotechnologie, Biotechnologie und Computertechnologie kommen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
